763
00:53:38,673 --> 00:53:39,633
- Benar.
- Tidak.

764
00:53:41,509 --> 00:53:44,346
Mungkin temperamen Nn. Hong buruk…

765
00:53:46,348 --> 00:53:47,390
tapi dia gesit.

766
00:53:49,809 --> 00:53:52,145
Aku gesit
dan bisa berikan bantuan bermanfaat.

767
00:53:54,105 --> 00:53:56,441
Mohon bantu sebisa mungkin.

768
00:54:01,112 --> 00:54:02,238
Presdir datang.

769
